OL,3,GNEWSAWine-drinking driver among
OL,4,Ashocking images caught in AI camera
OL,5,Atrial
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn artificial intelligence trial has
OL,8,Funcovered nearly 19,000 potential
OL,9,Fdriving offences in two weeks,
OL,10,Fincluding a driver drinking from a
OL,11,Fbottle of wine and another inhaling
OL,12,Ffrom balloons.
OL,14,FAI-powered cameras installed outside
OL,15,FLadywood fire station in Birmingham and
OL,16,FFallings Park in Wolverhampton also
OL,17,Fcaptured drivers holding mobile phones
OL,18,Fat the wheel and failing to wear
OL,19,Fseatbelts.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
