OL,3,GNEWSAWine-drinking driver among
OL,4,Ashocking images caught in AI camera
OL,5,Atrial
OL,6,
OL,7,FMat MacDonald, the West Midlands Road
OL,8,FSafety Commissioner, described the
OL,9,Ffindings highlighted a "huge problem"
OL,10,Fwith driving behaviours in the region.
OL,12,FHe said another image, which showed a
OL,13,Fchild "sitting unrestrained on a front
OL,14,Fpassenger's lap", was "particularly
OL,15,Fshocking".
